  "body": "### What is the issue with the URL Standard?\n\nCurrent standard points to UTS46 revision 33, but there is a [new revision 35](https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr46/tr46-35.html) with the recently released Unicode 17.0.0.\n\nAccording to [the modifications](https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr46/tr46-35.html#Modifications) section, it seems the only change is pointing to the new Unicode version, with no changes to processing.",
